### Health
GET http://localhost:8081/health

### Products
GET http://localhost:8081/products

### Create order
POST http://localhost:8081/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "customer_email": "student@example.com"
}

### Get order by id
GET http://localhost:8081/orders/1

### Capture payment for order
POST http://localhost:8081/orders/1/payments

### List payments for order
GET http://localhost:8081/orders/1/payments

### Discount
POST http://localhost:8081/orders/discount
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 1000,
  "discount_percent": 0
}

### Slow request demo
POST http://localhost:8081/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "customer_email": "slow@example.com",
  "order_number": "SLOW-001",
  "simulate_slow": true
}

### Race verification from shell
# ORDER_ID=1
# seq 1 20 | xargs -I{} -P 20 curl -s -X POST http://localhost:8081/orders/$ORDER_ID/payments
